      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Find a worthwhile SaaS opportunity for owners of small\nservice businesses with 2–20 employees. I haven’t chosen\nthe business category, problem or product. Start with their\nproblems, consider three opportunities, then choose one.",
